cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "r9cam: Raspberry Pi camera plugin for the R9lab platform"
abstract: >-
  Device-side software for automated image capture on Raspberry Pi, integrated with the
  R9lab platform. A FastAPI service captures still images with
  per-capture camera metadata, serves a live preview, pairs to R9lab over an outbound
  WebSocket relay with device-signed tokens, and uploads captures with a disk-backed retry
  queue.
